{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undead Kingdom Survivors is a fast paced action-roguelite multiplayer game where you have to survive an onslaught of the undead enemies. Unlock multiple characters, choose powerful abilities and strengthen yourself with upgrades to vanquish your enemies.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE WITH YOUR FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944350/extras/e9ba382bb02c96366c7ca236a31ac07d.poster.avif?t=1761328812\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944350/extras/e9ba382bb02c96366c7ca236a31ac07d.webm?t=1761328812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944350/extras/e9ba382bb02c96366c7ca236a31ac07d.mp4?t=1761328812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Assemble up to 2 additional friends to slay your enemies in co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE A HERO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944350/extras/68acf8f8f6fca7999a70751b4ac8f495.poster.avif?t=1761328812\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944350/extras/68acf8f8f6fca7999a70751b4ac8f495.webm?t=1761328812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944350/extras/68acf8f8f6fca7999a70751b4ac8f495.mp4?t=1761328812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose among various heroes and their various strengths and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OR SURVIVE ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944350/extras/911b9a35e8d94db88590e0a1ae218c6d.poster.avif?t=1761328812\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944350/extras/911b9a35e8d94db88590e0a1ae218c6d.webm?t=1761328812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944350/extras/911b9a35e8d94db88590e0a1ae218c6d.mp4?t=1761328812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to play alone and fight the hordes by yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy thousands of undead minions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge the constant spell casting of Necros</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 2 friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock higher difficulties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock mighty heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock multiple maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose powerful abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect points and be the best in the rankings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various and unique achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock upgrades to strengthen yourself</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Finish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2944350/84fe5252bdf49b01db1ff8c982f04236f1216874.jpg"},{"name":"Round Level 30","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2944350/53dee74ee8e3ae007b5eb609fa441bbc4de81989.jpg"},{"name":"Slash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity